diff --git a/IDEA_SOURCE.md b/IDEA_SOURCE.md
--- a/IDEA_SOURCE.md
+++ b/IDEA_SOURCE.md
@@ -25,0 +26,10 @@
+
+## S03 fixed external regression references (20261025)
+
+Idea sources: the user's S3 request, the six canonical benchmark positions at
+https://www.chessprogramming.org/Perft_Results and the original Forge tactical
+fixtures in tests/tests.cpp. Only published benchmark data is used; no external
+engine implementation is imported. Two additional perft cases use the explicit
+rank-reflection/colour-swap bijection. All expected counts are fixed data, never
+learned from the tested executable. The optional test registration is OFF by
+default and changes no engine code, values, move ordering or runtime options.
